      "number": 0,
      "text": "In the name of God, the Gracious, the Merciful."
    },
    {
      "number": 1,
      "text": "Did We not soothe your heart?"
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "text": "And lift from you your burden."
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "text": "Which weighed down your back?"
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "text": "And raised for you your reputation?"
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "text": "With hardship comes ease."
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "text": "With hardship comes ease."
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "text": "When your work is done, turn to devotion."
    },
    {
